«

@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@
@@ Generic functions.

@@ Does the fullstring contain the substring?
@@ Both fullstring and substring should not be empty.
@@ (fullstring substring -- True/False)
@@
@@ See: https://stackoverflow.com/questions/16122481/java-implement-string-method-contains-without-built-in-method-contains
@@ Changes due to indexing from 1 in stead of 0.
«
	@@ Initialise result and substring index j.
	False  1
	
     	→ fullstring substring result j
	«
		1  fullstring size
		For i
			If
				@@ Do the fullstring and susbstring match on this position?
				fullstring i Get  substring j Get  =
			Then
				@@ Match!
				@@ Move forward in the substring.
				@@ Move forward in the fullstring, by the Next command.
				j  1 +  'j' Store
			Else
				@@ No match!
				@@ Reset the substring index.
				1 'j' Store
			End

			If
				@@ Does the substring fully match the fullstring?
				j  substring size 1 +  =
			Then
				@@ Cause a break out of the loop.
				True 'result' Store
				fullstring size  'i' Store
			End
		Next

		result
	»
»
TextContains Store

»
